    "text": "We say that a group is a Tarski monster if it is finitely generated, not cyclic, and all of its proper non-trivial subgroups are isomorphic to each other.\n\na) Do there exist amenable torsion-free Tarski monsters?\n\nb) Do there exist amenable Tarski monsters of prime exponent?",
